loop-1-title = You ask, once.
loop-1-text = Aloud in the kitchen, or in a message. Nestor answers right away and sets up a **watch**: whose it is, where to look, what to look for, when to stop.
loop-1-ask = Tell me as soon as the school writes back.
loop-1-say = I’ll keep an eye on your mail and tell you.
