loop-3-title = It finds the right person, in the right place.
loop-3-text = Home Assistant says where people are, as precisely as your home allows. Nestor decides who, where, how and when, and never cuts into a conversation. Move Léa and watch it decide.
loop-where = Where is Léa?
loop-where-office = In her office
loop-where-out = Out
loop-where-night = Asleep
loop-decide-office = Says it aloud, on the office speaker.
loop-decide-out = Writes to her phone.
loop-decide-night = Keeps it for the morning: quiet hours.
loop-say = Léa, the school wrote: Friday’s outing is on.

loop-4-title = No answer? It writes.
loop-4-text = Said aloud and nobody reacted? Shortly after, the message follows in writing, wherever Léa reads. She answers there, and the thread still knows what it is about.
loop-4-in = The school wrote: Friday’s outing is on. Bring a packed lunch.
loop-4-out = Thanks! Put it on the family calendar.
loop-4-done = Done. I’ll remind you about the lunch on Thursday evening.

loop-5-title = And you can always see why.
loop-5-text = Each step goes into the household’s journal with its reason. “Why did it speak to me?” always has an answer, in the admin.
